---
// src/components/SolutionsComparison.astro
---

<section id="who-uses-lift" class="py-24 relative bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-28">
    
    <!-- Section 27 to 31: Who Uses LIFT? -->
    <div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-600 font-mono">Ecosystem Fit</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
          Built for everyone around the transaction.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you are deploying capital, evaluating an acquisition, preparing for investment, or orchestrating specialist advisory reviews, LIFT provides a dedicated experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <!-- INVESTORS (Section 28) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-violet-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-700 uppercase">INVESTORS</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">PE • VC • Family Offices</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-2">Know what you're investing in.</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Bring diligence requests, documents, experts, findings and reporting into one connected investment workflow. Surface red flags before the IC meeting.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Single source of truth</span>
            <a href="/contact?persona=investor" class="text-xs font-semibold text-violet-700 hover:text-violet-800">Start Investor DD &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CORPORATES -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-700 uppercase">CORPORATES</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">M&A • Corporate Dev • Strategy</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-2">Coordinate complex M&A diligence.</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Coordinate internal deal teams, legal counsels, and external accounting specialists across domestic or cross-border acquisitions without confusion.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Multi-stream oversight</span>
            <a href="/contact?persona=corporate" class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800">Explore Corporate M&A &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FOUNDERS (Section 29) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase">FOUNDERS</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Startups • Growth Ventures</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-2">Be ready before diligence begins.</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Organise your documents, respond to requests, eliminate endless email chains, and keep investor due diligence moving swiftly toward closure.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Frictionless data room</span>
            <a href="/contact?persona=founder" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800">Prepare for DD &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ADVISORS (Section 30) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-700 uppercase">ADVISORS</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">CA • CS • Legal • Valuers</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-2">Work smarter across assignments.</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Give your professional team a structured environment for reviewing documents, managing queries, recording findings, and collaborating across workstreams.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Standardised review tools</span>
            <a href="/contact?persona=advisor" class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-700 hover:text-purple-800">Explore Advisor Workspace &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- INCUBATORS & ACCELERATORS (Section 31) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase">INCUBATORS & ACCELERATORS</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Startup Hubs • Ecosystems</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-2">Make every portfolio company diligence-ready.</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Standardise diligence readiness across your startup cohort and create a structured, repeatable path from early seed documentation to Series A investor readiness.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Cohort tracking & readiness</span>
            <a href="/contact?persona=incubator" class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800">Explore Cohort DD &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 32: LIFT vs Traditional DD Comparison -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-600 font-mono">Competitive Difference</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
          Replace DD chaos with a connected workflow.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          More than a data room. More than a checklist. More than a report. LIFT connects the entire diligence workflow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison Matrix Table -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 overflow-x-auto shadow-md">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 font-mono uppercase text-[11px]">
              <th class="pb-4 font-semibold">Diligence Dimension</th>
              <th class="pb-4 font-semibold text-slate-500">Traditional Due Diligence</th>
              <th class="pb-4 font-semibold text-violet-700">LIFT Operating Platform</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Scoping & Requests</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Static Excel checklists emailed around</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Smart DD structured workflows</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Document Repository</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Scattered folders & arbitrary Google Drive links</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Structured data room mapped to requirements</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Q&A Management</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Fragmented email chains & WhatsApp chats</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Central Query Hub with lifecycle states</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Specialist Review</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Separate experts working in disconnected silos</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Connected expert workspace & cross-collaboration</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Document Analysis</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Manual, slow reading of hundreds of pages</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Technology-assisted analysis (AI + Expert)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Risk Discovery</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Findings buried until final consolidation</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Live risk & findings registry by severity</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Progress Visibility</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Wait weeks for final report delivery</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Flash DD™ evolving real-time radar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Deliverable Synthesis</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Days of manual report copy-pasting</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-violet-700 font-semibold">Traceable, decision-ready reports</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-900">Source of Truth</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-slate-500">Multiple conflicting versions of spreadsheets</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 text-emerald-700 font-bold">One connected, auditable workspace</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 33: LIFT + GGAM Synergy -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-purple-200 shadow-md">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-700 font-mono">Institutional Backing</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">
              Technology meets professional expertise.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              LIFT provides the technology and workflow layer. GGAM brings professional expertise and transaction understanding. Together, they create a more structured approach to due diligence.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Access to and coordination with relevant professional expertise—including Chartered Accountants, Company Secretaries, legal counsels, and valuers—is facilitated seamlessly, subject to engagement terms and availability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
              <span class="text-violet-700 font-bold">LIFT Platform</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500">Workflow • Data Room • AI • Radar</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center text-slate-400 font-bold text-base">&times;</div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
              <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">GGAM Advisory</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500">CA • CS • Legal • Valuation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center text-slate-400 font-bold text-base">=</div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-violet-50 border border-violet-200 text-center">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading block">Intelligent Due Diligence</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-violet-700 font-semibold">Decision-ready clarity</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 62 & 63: Final Homepage CTA -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-600 font-semibold">
        From Information to Insight. From Insight to Decision.
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Ready to lift your DD process?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Start your next diligence assignment with a smarter, more connected workflow. Less chasing, less fragmentation, and more clarity.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/contact?intent=start-dd" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8b5cf6] to-[#d946ef] text-white shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(139,92,246,0.35)] hover:opacity-95 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all">
          Start a DD
        </a>
        <a href="/contact?intent=demo" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50 shadow-xs active:scale-[0.98] transition-all">
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">LIFT by GGAM</span> • Confidential • Traceable • Decision-Ready
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
